# 🍎 AI Fruit Identification Assistant

An AI-powered application designed to identify fruits from images and provide fruit-related information through a user-friendly interface. The project is organized into a React frontend, Python backend, machine-learning workspace, and supporting database and deployment configurations.

**GitHub Repository:** [AI_Fruit_Identification_Assistant](https://github.com/karnasah/AI_Fruit_Identification_Assistant)

---

## 📌 Overview

The AI Fruit Identification Assistant aims to make fruit identification easier using machine learning and image processing. Users can upload fruit images for identification, explore fruit information, and interact with additional tools provided by the application.

The project structure also includes modules for user authentication, fruit encyclopedia features, chatbot interaction, voice processing, analytics, and administration.

> **Note:** The availability of individual features depends on their current implementation, model files, and configuration.

## ✨ Features

### 🍇 Fruit Identification
- Identify fruits from uploaded images.
- Support camera-based image capture where implemented.
- Display prediction results and alternative predictions where supported.
- Provide a foundation for fruit classification using machine-learning models.

### 📚 Fruit Encyclopedia
- Browse and search fruit information.
- Organize fruit details and nutritional information.
- Provide a foundation for seasonal information and fruit comparisons.

### 👤 User Management
- User registration and login.
- Profile and account management.
- Identification history and favorites where implemented.

### 🤖 AI Chatbot
- Chat interface for fruit-related questions.
- Conversation history support where configured.

### 🎙️ Voice Interaction
- Speech recognition and voice commands.
- Text-to-speech responses where supported by the application and device.

### 📊 Dashboard and Analytics
- View identification history and usage statistics.
- Display activity information and analytics where implemented.

### 🛡️ Administration
- User and fruit-record management.
- Administrative dashboard and system monitoring components.

### 🧠 Machine Learning
- Image preprocessing and normalization.
- Model training and evaluation scripts.
- Support for TensorFlow/Keras and TensorFlow Lite model workflows.
- Project structure for ripeness detection, disease classification, and object detection.

