## 🔐 Security Considerations

- Keep environment files containing secrets out of version control.
- Use strong, unique authentication secrets.
- Validate uploaded images and enforce file-size limits.
- Protect administrative endpoints with appropriate authorization.
- Avoid logging passwords, access tokens, or sensitive information.
- Use HTTPS and secure production settings when deploying the application.
- Review dependencies and model artifacts before production use.

---

## ⚠️ Limitations

- Prediction quality depends on model accuracy and training data.
- Blurry, poorly lit, or unfamiliar images may produce incorrect results.
- Ripeness and disease predictions require suitable trained models and validation.
- Voice features depend on browser, device, and permission support.
- Nutritional information should be verified against reliable sources.

This application should not be treated as a substitute for professional medical or agricultural advice.

